          "impact": "The TMC2209 U6 coil output is shorted to the I2C SDA line. The driver will fight the bus and corrupt I2C traffic to the EZO-RTD, both isolators and any sensors on H5/H6. The Nutrient-A stepper coil also loses its return path, so the pump cannot be driven correctly, and the driver may be damaged.",
